  "behavior": [
    "Canonical server order grouped by parent, paginated by modules; repeated headings across pages, empty groups remain in their administration.",
    "Explicit Reorder/Done mode includes inactive rows and removes partial filters; restores normal searches, filters and pagination without undoing saved moves.",
    "Accessible atomic 44px controls use actual server neighbors, including across page boundaries; sticky Actions in desktop ordering tables, cards in xs.",
    "Both movement hooks await invalidation of moduleKeys.all, moduleGroupKeys.all and authorizationKeys.all, feeding Sidenav; one contextual success, no permissions success toast.",
    "No PATCH retries; conflicts and uncertain responses reconcile through reads, with recovery gate when a read fails and actor/session fences.",
    "Readonly locate_id in ordering GET locates module anchor and reads its page in one repeatable-read snapshot after module or group moves; no full catalog download.",
    "Ordering requests validate IDs, preconditions, returned identity/parent/rank/neighbors/page and actionable page metadata before enabling controls."
  ],
